{"1553590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Saveseeker", "steam_appid": 1553590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Hero defeated the world’s most notorious bosses, the future looked bright...until he took the boss title for himself. Now, the world's former savior has become its ultimate threat, planning to wipe the timeline and everyone in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Emmer Edette, the Hero's daughter, who inherits his ability to freeze and rewind time. Alongside Tippleton, a grumpy, world-weary dragon toy and her father's old travel companion, Emmer embarks on a journey across six vibrant lands to overwrite the Hero's Save Stops, recruit the bosses he once defeated, and save the world from the man who once saved it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A quest that begins at the end</strong> – Step into a world forever changed by a legendary Hero. Travel across six distinct lands, reclaim corrupted “Save Stops,” and uncover the truth behind your father’s downfall before he brings everything to ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.poster.avif?t=1785988546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.webm?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.mp4?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join forces with boss allies </strong>– Eager to confront the Hero that once defeated them, five ex-bosses will join you on your adventure—these former formidable foes have uniquely powerful abilities and action costs inspired by traditional RPG boss battles.  Discover their motivations, combine their skills in battle, and see how old enemies can become indispensable friends.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/6838bac48e5706f9a4679f6d7c7b79cc.poster.avif?t=1785988546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/6838bac48e5706f9a4679f6d7c7b79cc.webm?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/6838bac48e5706f9a4679f6d7c7b79cc.mp4?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art worlds full of character and challenge</strong> – Explore beautifully animated pixel art worlds, from the shadowy Badwoods to the mechanical marvel of the airship Aertemis. Each setting is packed with puzzles, enemies, and secrets tailored to its unique atmosphere.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/d44461862f41ad39f434f1969800d1a8.poster.avif?t=1785988546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/d44461862f41ad39f434f1969800d1a8.webm?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/d44461862f41ad39f434f1969800d1a8.mp4?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and surprises around every corner</strong> – Venture off the main path to play minigames, uncover hidden lore, and earn powerful equipment. Every discovery adds more depth to Emmer’s journey and rewards those who take time to explore.    <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.poster.avif?t=1785988546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.webm?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.mp4?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy 30+ original tracks </strong>– A warm and nostalgic original soundtrack composed by Dale &quot;Corgi King&quot; North accompanies your journey   <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.poster.avif?t=1785988546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.webm?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.mp4?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Hero defeated the world’s most notorious bosses, the future looked bright...until he took the boss title for himself. Now, the world's former savior has become its ultimate threat, planning to wipe the timeline and everyone in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Emmer Edette, the Hero's daughter, who inherits his ability to freeze and rewind time. Alongside Tippleton, a grumpy, world-weary dragon toy and her father's old travel companion, Emmer embarks on a journey across six vibrant lands to overwrite the Hero's Save Stops, recruit the bosses he once defeated, and save the world from the man who once saved it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A quest that begins at the end</strong> – Step into a world forever changed by a legendary Hero. Travel across six distinct lands, reclaim corrupted “Save Stops,” and uncover the truth behind your father’s downfall before he brings everything to ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.poster.avif?t=1785988546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.webm?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.mp4?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join forces with boss allies </strong>– Eager to confront the Hero that once defeated them, five ex-bosses will join you on your adventure—these former formidable foes have uniquely powerful abilities and action costs inspired by traditional RPG boss battles.  Discover their motivations, combine their skills in battle, and see how old enemies can become indispensable friends.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l