tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.poster.avif?t=1785988546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.webm?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.mp4?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy 30+ original tracks </strong>– A warm and nostalgic original soundtrack composed by Dale &quot;Corgi King&quot; North accompanies your journey   <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.poster.avif?t=1785988546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.webm?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.mp4?t=1785988546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p>", "short_description": "Embark on a quest to overwrite save points in Saveseeker, a turn-based RPG about a time-traveling girl who must save the world from her father.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/1b8083254155a2267116b21820d3ad3a93c6ccb9/header.jpg?t=1785988546", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/bb29644936088d96457c926386423815a8944261/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785988546", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/bb29644936088d